    "caveats": [
      "The bundled report is dated 2026-05-20 and describes 5,295,956 rows, whereas these pinned bytes contain 10,796,714. Its numerical analyses are not independently reproduced here.",
      "Early records have null unit, is_new_measurement, and snapshot_update_time. A True-only is_new_measurement filter would discard those historical rows.",
      "Rows are API property updates, not independent physical experiments or raw shot records. Split and deduplicate by property calibration identity and timestamp before drift analysis.",
      "T1/T2 unit null versus us reflects an upstream schema transition; retain raw units and only apply the explicit provenance-backed transition conversion. Never infer units from magnitude alone.",
      "Environmental columns are observational external covariates and are excluded from model fitting; no humidity or weather coupling is established.",
      "Calibration is collected by a third party from IBM APIs, not an official IBM time-series release.",
      "Calibration properties are refreshed on different schedules. Use calibrated_time for property freshness and observed_time for acquisition availability.",
      "No raw QEC shot outcomes are contained in these calibration rows.",
      "No transition-frequency property family is present in this pinned drift archive. Frequency is available in the separate official Manila snapshot only."
    ],
